AUDIO: 'I start to feel this kickup spring in my step that\'s coming from here. And it\'s like a&nbsp;&nbsp; little kick kick like that can be brought up&nbsp; to three different power levels. The&nbsp;&nbsp; two is the one I\'ve been doing most of the time.&nbsp; And it feels really noticeable. And at first it&nbsp;&nbsp;'

